Subject: [PATCH 01/19] POR-114: Prepare live scope recovery across Portal
 navigation

Pass targeted formatting, lint and Portal type checks. Add opt-in live assertions for real foreign-scope refusals, response content, history, workspace changes and a second login. Keep the fixture browser and PostgreSQL verification pending the exclusive Mac window.
---
