Subject: [PATCH 11/19] UX-111: Inject isolated preview download failures over
 HTTP

Use browser-local cookies to refuse one JSON asset in Vite preview without replacing shared build files. Keep the installed Control server unchanged. Pass configuration tests, formatting, lint and type checks; native browser qualification remains pending.
---
 docs/research/in-product-help.md              | 13 ++++++++
 web/packages/config/package.json              |  3 +-
 .../config/src/preview-download-failure.ts    | 29 +++++++++++++++++
 web/packages/config/src/vite.ts               |  2 ++
 web/packages/shell/testing/help-flows.ts      | 32 ++++++++++++-------
 5 files changed, 66 insertions(+), 13 deletions(-)
