Subject: [PATCH 16/19] GW-120: Preserve UI scope across late saves and refused
 catalogue refreshes

Keep delayed editor answers from closing another dialog. Remove cached catalogue descriptions after a 403 or 404, while retaining known data and a retry notice for transient refresh failures.

Verified 28 Console and 23 Portal Chromium cases without skips or retries. Read eight bilingual editor, revision-review, catalogue and permission screenshots, including 390px layouts.
